# Filled-in credentials never belong in this repository: git would commit them, and
# `crossplane xpkg build --examples-root examples` packs every *.yaml and *.yml file under
# examples/ (ignored or not) into the published package. The *.tmpl files create the Secret from
# outside the repository; these names only catch a copy filled in here by mistake.
secret.yaml
namespaced-secret.yaml
